 attention.</p><p class="m-0 mb-[18px] text-[12px] italic text-[#5a6660]">This tool provides educational information only and does not diagnose, treat, or replace professional medical advice. Consult a qualified healthcare professional for personalized medical guidance.</p><button type="button" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 py-[18px] px-8 border border-white/30 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#43C3F2] to-[#1341A3] font-semibold text-base tracking-[-0.005em] cursor-pointer shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(19,65,163,0.3),_0_2px_6px_rgba(19,65,163,0.15)] transition-all duration-150 hover:from-[#1341A3] hover:to-[#0f3180] hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-px" style="color:#ffffff">Build my awareness map<span class="text-lg leading-none">→</span></button></div></div><style>
        @keyframes nfPulse {
          0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(19,65,163,0.18); }
          50%      { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(19,65,163,0.06); }
